Package: mgc
Type: Package
Title: Probabilistic Clustering of Matrix and Graph Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dmitriy", "Usoltsev", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "usoltsev@example.com")
)
Description: Implements probabilistic matrix and graph clustering
    algorithms as described in the dissertation 'Methods of Probabilistic
    Clustering for Interpreting Matrix and Graph Information from
    Heterogeneous Databases'.  Includes Mahalanobis-based control
    cohort selection and an MCMC search for active network modules.
